The Seating layout tab of an opened venue.

### Display

- The venue's room plans, each with its name and its first image — [reads](aim:juicebar.locations#Record:Location), [reads](aim:juicebar.locations#Record:RoomPlan), [invokes](aim:juicebar.locations#Capability:RoomPlans), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.locations.seating#Requirements[PLANLIST])
- Add and Remove are shown only to staff with `room-plan:role#update` — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.locations.seating#Requirements[PLANWHO])

### Actions

